{"type":"standard","title":"Adam Hamilton (pastor)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Adam Hamilton (pastor)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q4679181","titles":{"canonical":"Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)","normalized":"Adam Hamilton (pastor)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Adam Hamilton (pastor)</span></span>"},"pageid":23640310,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Adam_Hamilton_on_the_Courage_to_Preach_%28cropped%29.png/330px-Adam_Hamilton_on_the_Courage_to_Preach_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":349},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/Adam_Hamilton_on_the_Courage_to_Preach_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1020,"height":1080},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376714051","tid":"0d65d715-b922-11f1-b202-01d4ed13c53e","timestamp":"2026-09-25T20:45:33Z","description":"American minister and U.S. Senate candidate (born 1964)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Adam_Hamilton_(pastor)"}},"extract":"Adam Hamilton is an American minister, author, and political candidate. He is the senior pastor of the Resurrection, a United Methodist Church, the largest United Methodist congregation in the United States, with multiple locations in the Greater Kansas City area. He is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Kansas.","extract_html":"<p><b>Adam Hamilton</b> is an American minister, author, and political candidate. He is the senior pastor of the Resurrection, a United Methodist Church, the largest United Methodist congregation in the United States, with multiple locations in the Greater Kansas City area. He is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Kansas.</p>"}